.roomodes
.windsurfrules
.roo/
.taskmaster/
.cursor/
.clinerules
.windsurf/
.trae/
.gemini/

# Agent-specific instruction files. AGENTS.md is tracked on purpose: it is the
# contract every agent works against, and hiding it is how it silently drifted
# out of date (documenting scripts and directory layouts that no longer exist).
# CLAUDE.md stays local.
CLAUDE.md

